[gold]封印[/gold]。[gold]回火[/gold]。
造成 {BaseDamage:diff()} 点伤害，次数为本回合打出[gold]咏唱[/gold]牌数量的两倍。{InCombat:cond:
（造成 {Damage:diff()} 点伤害 {Hits} 次）|}

[gold]传说魔法[/gold]。
获得 {Block:diff()} 点格挡，再获得等于三牌堆[gold]魔力[/gold]总数的格挡。{InCombat:cond:
（获得{CalculatedBlock:diff()}点格挡）|}

[gold]Sealed[/gold]. [gold]Backfire[/gold].
Deal {BaseDamage:diff()} damage twice for each [gold]Chant[/gold] card played this turn.{InCombat:cond:
(Deal {Damage:diff()} damage {Hits} times.)|}

[gold]Legendary Spell[/gold].
Gain {Block:diff()} Block plus Block equal to your total [gold]Mana[/gold].{InCombat:cond:
(Gain {CalculatedBlock:diff()} Block)|}
